## The Director's office

::bg{location="earth-gym" time="day"}
::music{action="change" mood="tense" volume="down"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: At the back of the gym there is no arena, only an office: a desk, a map of Verdane stuck with black pins, and a tall man standing at the window with his back to the door.
@narrator{code="0020" when="holds('defeated', ['earthGymAdminSelene'])"}: Selene's voice crackles from a radio on the desk: "Director. The child is through. I could not hold them." He switches it off.
@narrator{code="0030"}: The leader of the Earth Gym turns around. It is the voice from the radio.

## Director Vex

::use{component="gymLeader" who="vex" badge="earth" intro="So. The child who has been taking my Team apart one lair at a time. I am Director Vex. I lead Team Eclipse, and on weekdays, this gym. Let us see whether the ground holds you up." win="Hm. The ground moved. I did not think it could. Take the Earth Badge. You have earned it more honestly than I earned this gym." lose="The ground does not move for children. Go home." prize="5000" instance="use-001"}
@vex{code="0010" when="@wonFight" emotion="determined"}: Every pin on that map is a place you went before my people could finish. The dig, the tower, the Corner, the Tower again. I should have hired you.
